{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Quest log: a client that announces 0x8F6 cannot swap past the log size or move a timed quest out of the native log",
  "contract": [
    "With Quests.LogSize 30 and a full log of 30, a 0x8F6 client's CMSG_QUESTLOG_SWAP_QUEST (403) may address slots up to 63, but a swap that moves a quest into an empty slot at or above the log size is refused, so the emptied native slot cannot be used to exceed Quests.LogSize.",
    "A swap that would put a timed quest (A Hunter's Boast, 257) into a slot of 25 or more is refused: timed quests stay in the native log. A swap between two occupied slots, 1 and 27, goes through."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "quest_log_size": 30,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 20
    }
  ],
